{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-36","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":36,"points":null,"unitId":"renal","unitLabel":"배설·체액 조절","topic":"오줌·신장·네프론","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["renal","endocrine","cell","biomol"],"stem":"그림은신장의네프론에서오줌이생성되는과정을나타낸\n것이다.\n네프론의각부위에서일어나는물질이동에관한설명으로\n옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. (가)에서는포도당, 아미노산, 요소등이여과된다.\nㄴ. (나)에서는Na+ 이온이주변조직으로능동수송되며\n이를차단하면오줌량이감소한다.\nㄷ. 알도스테론은Na+ 이온을(다)관밖으로수송시킨다.\nㄹ. (라)에서요소의일부가신장의수질로확산되어수분의\n재흡수가촉진된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":430,"height":347,"region":0,"bbox":[78.111,46.872,172.0,138.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-36/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":310,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,249.272,297.6,124.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-36/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[373.089,539.928,690.55,962.147],"width":317.462,"height":422.219,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[78.111,46.872,172.0,138.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.111,249.272,297.6,124.0],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"36. 그림은신장의네프론에서오줌이생성되는과정을나타낸","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.388,11.032],"spans":[{"text":"3","bbox":[5.0,5.0,6.498,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.826],"size":10.753,"flags":0,